/tmp/array3-cohere-fixtures/library_array_alias_every.ts:1:5 error prefer-const This binding is declared `let` but nothing ever reassigns it, so the `let` claims a mutability the code does not use. A reader has to hold open the possibility that the value changes somewhere, and has to scan the rest of the scope to find out that it does not. `const` answers that question at the declaration and lets the compiler reject a future write that was not intended. Declare it `const`.
